{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01306","headline":"相和歌辞 长门怨 · 袁晖","name":"相和歌辞 长门怨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"早知君爱歇，本自无萦妬。\n谁使恩情深，今来反相误。\n愁眠罗帐晓，泣坐金闺暮。\n独有梦中魂，犹言意如故。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"袁晖","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01306.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01306","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}